{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1000_p", "source_sha256": "36806f18e8447ba82382cd975dd0bf494b1b50e9f813c41b580db0d11e58e209", "ja": "（今日は、環と紬が主演したドラマのリリース記念\nイベント。二人は、天使と悪魔の姫を演じている……）", "zh": "（今天是环和紬主演的电视剧发售纪念活动。两人饰演的是天使和恶魔的公主……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "fc40615b46552450bf6fd855a8f0678eab2fafdfcc5b7750122edaaa783d271b", "ja": "じゃあ、たまきは掃除担当ねっ！\nいろんなところをピカピカにしちゃうぞ～！", "zh": "那环就负责打扫吧！\n把各个地方都擦得闪闪发亮～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9ab687a91c0d3f20f41144ae4501764aaab49381feb6487025fa6b1c108c74b1", "ja": "ふふ、では私はお洗濯を……。\nこの調子であれば、いい具合に分担ができそうですね。", "zh": "呵呵，那我就负责洗衣服吧……。\n照这样看来，应该能分工得很不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1003_p", "source_sha256": "62d0d969c25d5816a75ded134483ec7cd59f3a39f6628abe4449dc79189dfacb", "ja": "ふたりともお疲れ様！　ずいぶん\n盛り上がってるみたいだけど、何の話をしてたんだ？", "zh": "两位辛苦啦！看起来聊得很起劲嘛，你们刚才在聊什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "a0803f0f7f8a1082b58cb4f369005b46098a7dfe1c882d4f68303965c385726c", "ja": "あ、おやぶん！　今ね、つむぎと一緒に住んだら、\nどんな風になるか考えてたんだ～。", "zh": "啊，老大！我刚才在想，要是和紬一起住的话，会变成什么样呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1e9576f917f030c81185ecbc14ef081bf3487443a61ec8ceb0d75c14125670a4", "ja": "ええ。ファンレターに書いてあったんです。\n私達二人が暮らした場合、分担はどうするのかと。", "zh": "嗯。粉丝来信里写了这个问题。要是我们两个人一起生活，家务该怎么分工呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f8d67fcefb3fd62adb9e9b897b4335bbce660f9f2a818b9adbd901f203d8040b", "ja": "なるほど。ドラマでも天使と悪魔は同居したからな。\n紬と環が同居したら、か……。", "zh": "原来如此。在电视剧里天使和恶魔也一起生活过呢。\n要是紬和环一起生活的话……康。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "330b7980929af0df6f8ca6d5a9c4d76161cf2e8e17af3cfd1af2bb5f57d0e245", "ja": "たまきはね、つむぎと一緒に暮らしたら\nやりたいこと、いーっぱいあるんだ～！", "zh": "环呢，要是和紬一起生活的话，\n有好多好多想做的事呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "30acc069746bd4d095067f810702b6265a595f04895f48db3dec7a9882be8f4a", "ja": "毎日公園に行ったり、ゲームしたり……\nあとやっぱり、虫取りもしたい！", "zh": "每天去公园玩，或者一起打游戏……  \n还有，果然还是想去捉虫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ec385a5dfa8659a631e49f8a274398dfaf29cf585357a97e989655965f59922f", "ja": "そうですね。でも大神さん、遊ぶのもいいですが、\n勉強やお仕事もきちんとしないと……。", "zh": "是啊。不过大神同学，玩耍是很好，但学习和工作也得认真完成才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bb6bebf6007253016c2d5834a11cadecabbc0212ca51e60784317002f9c33b5d", "ja": "やるべきことを後回しにしてしまっては、\n全力で楽しめなくなってしまいますから。", "zh": "要是把该做的事都往后拖，就没法尽情享受了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1011_p", "source_sha256": "5de6b797ad2669fe76bd8b6ea1a50893d7538be26403c3b50d5d6a1923de8359", "ja": "ははっ。本人達の生活もドラマみたいになりそうだな。\nマイペースな環と世話焼きな紬……いいじゃないか！", "zh": "哈哈。她们自己的生活也要变得像电视剧一样了吧。随性自在的环和爱操心的紬……这不是挺好的吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "c73aa5883e76f7fcb659ea33b399f802b8529e986329dd44a4f722a9f15e186e", "ja": "くふふ♪　……ねえねえ、つむぎ。\n今度おうちに泊まりに行ってもいい？", "zh": "咕呵呵♪……呐呐，紬。\n下次我可以去你家住吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "9471467c72117eb57e1456f5a26c4abc765343653faba1fb3bd38fb4b52666de", "ja": "まくら投げとかお料理とか一緒にして……\nつむぎともっと仲良くなりたいぞ～！", "zh": "想一起玩枕头大战、一起做饭……\n想和紬变得更加要好～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6c7dbfea23f27390d72f36b32c038ad03ec59c55d386b049a5e0b031b3dee170", "ja": "ふふ。そういうことでしたら是非。\nですが、ご両親の許可はいただいてくださいね。", "zh": "呵呵，既然是这样，那就请务必来吧。\n不过，要先得到你父母的允许哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "5496193285d2f405963bf2cb6f8fecd643ad47c5cb0af649d5589299dcfe29f1", "ja": "わかった！　……あ、おやぶんもくる？\nおやぶんもいたら、もっと楽しいぞ～！", "zh": "知道啦！……啊，老大也要来吗？\n要是老大也在的话，就更开心啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cc9902c35f5c4ded6a2c6a52eb36a5df1862a4227aa21496ba816c0c1c9267e4", "ja": "大神さん！？　{$P$}はさすがに……\nまさかあなたも乗り気なのではありませんよね？", "zh": "大神同学！？　{$P$}未免也太……\n难道您也跃跃欲试了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1017_p", "source_sha256": "41f1c3d01e9650ed5cef1d471fb1cbc9d8b4b54b19bb5ebaa21ab2b2f114fa35", "ja": "い、いやいや。流石にそれは……。\nふたりでゆっくり楽しんでくれ。", "zh": "不、不用了不用了。那还是算了吧……\n你们两个人好好享受吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "aae5f399a0a26ba2bdd9e162d0e695fd7182fe4e3b989c14d9487f684059530e", "ja": "ふふ、それでは大神さん。\nお泊りの件は、後ほどゆっくり相談いたしましょう。", "zh": "呵呵，那么大神小姐。\n关于留宿的事，稍后我们再慢慢商量吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "49f8df3087e597e9ca0399770a4e98268fecc3086614ea057ba541b2a4b98ac1", "ja": "うん！　つむぎとお泊り、楽しみだな～♪", "zh": "嗯！和紬一起过夜，好期待啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0494_1020_p", "source_sha256": "54c95db0e8573ddddca016b386f81bad1752a82916abd193e7a6bc30cef0210a", "ja": "（二人は今回の仕事でずいぶん仲良くなったみたいだ！\nでもなんだろう……少し……少し……）", "zh": "（两人似乎因为这次工作变得亲近了不少！可是怎么回事……有点……有点……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
